.env*
__pycache__

# Profile activation state is per-machine / per-session; do not track.
_profiles/

# Local SSoT rescue/quarantine state is operational scratch, not skill source.
.quarantine/

# Generated source-command shims are compatibility wrappers, not real skills.
source-command-*/

# Generated activation roots. A projection is controller-owned output that
# `skillex sync` rewrites; committing one publishes machine-specific symlinks
# that dangle everywhere else. 76 such links shipped in this repo pointing at a
# registry cache that exists on no machine at all.
**/.agents/skills/
**/.claude/skills/
**/.codex/skills/
